OL,3,GNEWSANature reserves spot rare species
OL,4,Aduring heatwaves
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife trust said some species had
OL,7,Fbeen spotted in nature reserves this
OL,8,Fsummer for the first time in years.
OL,10,FVolunteers for the Herts and Middlesex
OL,11,FWildlife Trust recorded a great white
OL,12,Fegret near Ware and more than 300
OL,13,FChalkhill blue butterflies at Hexton
OL,14,FChalk Pit near Hitchin, where they also
OL,15,Ffound a glow-worm for the first time in
OL,16,F25 years.
OL,18,FThe trust said it was partly due to the
OL,19,Funusually hot weather but also the
OL,20,Fresult of increased surveying and
OL,21,Fmonitoring in the county.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
