OL,3,GNEWSANature reserves spot rare species
OL,4,Aduring heatwaves
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior reserves officer Dan Townsend
OL,7,Fsaid: "This summer we've had some
OL,8,Fextraordinary records, from species
OL,9,Fthat haven't been recorded in
OL,10,FHertfordshire for decades to new
OL,11,Fdiscoveries for individual reserves."
